    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us6000q6br](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us6000q6br) Magnitude 5.6 earthquake at 30.698 depth occurred on Apr 15 2025 45km SW of Maitum. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude 5.7551 longitude 124.2328. It impacted 100360 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
